## Throughput test

```bash
# Install hey: go install github.com/rakyll/hey@latest

# Non-streaming throughput
hey -n 100 -c 4 \
    -m POST \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{"model":"local-gemma-code","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"Say hello"}],"max_tokens":50}' \
